---
import PageSite from "@layouts/PageSite.astro";
import Hero from "@components/redesign/Hero.astro";

const facts = [
  { big: "20+", text: "languages spoken at home" },
  { big: "70%+", text: "first-generation Americans" },
  { big: "50%+", text: "qualify for free or reduced lunch" },
  { big: "100%", text: "graduation rate" },
];
const more = [
  { name: "Robots", href: "/about/history" },
  { name: "Departments", href: "/about/departments" },
  { name: "Leadership", href: "/about/leadership" },
  { name: "Mentors", href: "/about/mentors" },
  { name: "FTC teams", href: "/about/ftc" },
  { name: "Board", href: "/about/board" },
];
---

<PageSite title="About" description="StuyPulse is FIRST Robotics Team 694 from Stuyvesant High School in New York City: about 150 students, no cuts and no tryouts." fullBleed>
  <Hero
    title="We are StuyPulse."
    intro="FIRST Robotics Team 694 from Stuyvesant High School. Our name comes from being the heart of our school and our community."
    photo="/team/2026.jpg"
    photoAlt="The StuyPulse team in 2026"
    stickers={["Team 694", "About 150 students"]}
  >
    <Fragment slot="actions">
      <a class="pill pill-white" href="#video">Watch our video</a>
      <a class="pill pill-ghost" href="/join">Join the team</a>
    </Fragment>
  </Hero>

  <section class="band mission" aria-labelledby="mission">
    <h2 id="mission" class="band-title">Find your pulse.</h2>
    <div class="cols">
      <p class="lede">
        Our mission is to help students find their pulse for lifelong learning, through a team culture that shares knowledge
        and gives back to the community.
      </p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Through FIRST Robotics Competitions we build skills in engineering, programming, business, teamwork and leadership.
          We want anyone even slightly interested in STEM to get the chance to explore it, so we're a no-cut, no-tryout team
          where everyone has a place.
        </p>
        <p>
          We also want to inspire people around us, and teach them about science and engineering through outreach events.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="facts" aria-labelledby="who">
    <h2 id="who">Who we are</h2>
    <ul>
      {facts.map((fact) => <li><b>{fact.big}</b><span>{fact.text}</span></li>)}
    </ul>
    <p>
      We stay close despite our size. Team dinners, extravaganzas and birthday shout-outs help, and so do the long trips to
      regionals across the country. Most of us go on to some of the best universities in the world, and we push each other to
      do well in school.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="video" aria-labelledby="video-title">
    <h2 id="video-title" class="band-title">Our 2024 Impact Award video</h2>
    <div class="video">
      <iframe
        src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/WiNKmPqEj0c"
        title="StuyPulse 2024 Impact Award video"
        loading="lazy"
        allow="accelerometer; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
        allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band split" aria-labelledby="today">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2 id="today" class="band-title">Team 694 today</h2>
      <p>
        About 150 students compete in the FIRST Robotics Competition each year. During build season we work almost every day
        in our lab at Stuyvesant, designing, building and programming the robot with help from parents and volunteer
        mentors.
      </p>
      <p>
        We share what we know with teams who need it. We mentor FRC, FTC and FLL teams and schools across the city, and run
        demos in and around our school. At competitions, PulseCrew, a group of experienced students, helps other FRC teams
        fix software and mechanical problems.
      </p>
      <p>
        When we opened our new lab in December 2022, we demoed our robot for school staff, City Council members and
        senators, and in November 2025 an Assembly member toured the lab.
      </p>
      <p>
        We've been champions many times. In 2025 we won all three of our regionals and reached the semifinals, and in 2026
        Tribecbot won the New York City Regional. We've qualified for the Championship in Houston for the last several years.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure>
      <img src="/team/HVR.jpg" alt="StuyPulse at the 2025 Hudson Valley Regional" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption>At the 2025 Hudson Valley Regional</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="band split reverse" aria-labelledby="start">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2 id="start" class="band-title">How we started</h2>
      <p>
        StuyPulse was founded in the fall of 2000 by students and parents ready to build their first robot. Few of them knew
        each other before, but they quickly learned to work together, and gathered the members, sponsors and mentors the
        team still has today. After raising the money for the FIRST entry fees, they scored highest in their division at
        the Championship in their rookie year.
      </p>
      <h2 class="band-title media">In the news</h2>
      <p>
        Spreading the message of FIRST is a big part of what we do. The TriBeCa Tribune, Tribeca Citizen and China Daily
        have covered our build seasons, and we're often in our school paper, The Spectator. We've been interviewed on radio
        and TV in Arabic, Russian and English, and appear often on the FUN Robotics Network YouTube channel.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="first" id="first">
      <img src="/icons/first-logo.svg" alt="FIRST" />
      <h2 class="band-title">About FIRST</h2>
      <p>
        FIRST (For Inspiration and Recognition of Science and Technology) is a nonprofit founded by Dean Kamen in 1989. Its
        programs inspire young people to pursue science, technology and engineering, and to build teamwork, outreach and
        leadership skills along the way, with help from businesses, volunteers, teachers and parents.
      </p>
      <a class="pill pill-red" href="https://www.firstinspires.org/">Visit FIRST</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="band more" aria-labelledby="more-title">
    <h2 id="more-title" class="band-title">More about us</h2>
    <ul>
      {more.map((link) => <li><a class="pill pill-line" href={link.href}>{link.name}</a></li>)}
    </ul>
  </nav>
</PageSite>

<style>
  .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(24px, 5vw, 64px);
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .cols .lede {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .cols .prose p:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .facts {
    margin: 0 20px;
    padding: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px) var(--gutter);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--red);
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .facts h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.4rem);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .facts ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 44px 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .facts li {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--red);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .facts b {
    font-size: 48px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 96;
  }
  .facts li span {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .facts p {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 44px auto 0;
    font-size: 19px;
    opacity: 0.94;
  }
  .video {
    margin-top: 32px;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--ink);
  }
  .video iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }
  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 72px);
    align-items: start;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .split h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .split .media {
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  figure {
    margin: 0;
  }
  figure img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: var(--soft);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .first {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--blush);
    padding: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 44px);
  }
  .first img {
    height: 56px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .first p {
    margin: 14px 0 24px;
    color: var(--soft);
  }
  .more {
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .more ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .cols,
    .split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .facts {
      margin: 0 12px;
    }
    .facts li {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .facts b {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
    .facts li span {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
